Third-party sources and attributions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

ABIM pass-probability estimates approximate the prediction curves published in:
  McDonald FS, Jurich D, Duhigg LM, Paniagua M, Chick D, Wells M, Williams A, Alguire P.
  Correlations Between the USMLE Step Examinations, American College of Physicians
  In-Training Examination, and ABIM Internal Medicine Certification Examination.
  Acad Med. 2020;95(9):1388-1395. doi:10.1097/ACM.0000000000003382
The coefficients used here are a logistic fit to points read from those published curves;
they are not coefficients published by the authors. The authors and their organizations
have not reviewed or endorsed this software.

